
# Local env files — ALL of them. The narrow list (.env, .env.local, .env.*.local) does not
# match .env.build / .env.pull / .env.vercel-check / .env.production.batch, which is how a
# live service-role key reached a pushed branch. Templates stay tracked via the ! lines.
.env*
!.env.example
!.env.sample
!.env.template
